change_type: instructions   changelog: - Updated CLI dependency from `mcporter` to the new `mcpc` tool for all workflows. - Changed the required Node.js package from `mcporter` to `@apify/mcpc`. - All task and workflow commands now reference `mcpc` instead of `mcporter`. - No changes to scraping logic or available Actors; functionality remains the same.

